{"parentUuid":"eda34983-46a8-4840-a7cd-465f36881877","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTzsb17nwfkD7qLTV2SQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm deciding to shrink the role line by one step and lean into a light theme with Baseplate blocks, avoiding heavy orange backgrounds. For roles placement, I'm settling on putting them in the name tile under the name, right where they'd naturally sit in the Baseplate layout.\n\nNow I need a light-mode palette for Blocks — paper ground, cobalt ink, persimmon accent — and have to rethink how the isometric JT lettering inverts on a paper background. Rather than build blind, I'll have r7-blocks prototype two light Baseplate palette variants first for approval, while remix-hero ports the role line and plotter into src in parallel to avoid conflicts; once Jarod signs off on the palette, the light Baseplate gets ported too. I should log these decisions and update the feedback doc.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3303,"cache_read_input_tokens":279736,"output_tokens":2104,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":385},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3303,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2104,"cache_read_input_tokens":279736,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3303},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6943,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","serverClassifierRequest":"acad8b3a-6fb5-4c48-bfca-6656fcaf51d9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgTzsZBjV8ELRbHwnAH4M","r