{"parentUuid":"9d5a520a-d089-4755-8776-f3ea0a80feb1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01M8u6eiZNW3MvrqQSPB37cY","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9e9db1b5-912d-4591-8eaa-faf871890ca6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T04:24:55.774Z","session_id":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/jarod/Code/personal/jarodtaylor.com","sessionId":"e071936d-eecf-4712-8180-225a10b3edb2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"generic-pondering-plum"}
{"parentUuid":"9e9db1b5-912d-4591-8eaa-faf871890ca6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgTzvBUbmv25S3zMRPBF7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good picks. Logged.\n\n1. **Where the roles go in Baseplate:** yes, in your name block, right under the name. In the HTML the roles come straight after your name in every brand, so the name tile is where they naturally sit.\n2. **Light Blocks:** I'm in favour. It also fixes Fable's earlier note that all three brands were dark, so Remix now shows a real light/dark range. It's a new palette, so it goes through a quick prototype first:\n   - The Blocks agent is making **2 light variants of Baseplate**, e.g. warm paper vs cool white, and persimmon vs cobalt as the lead accent.\n   - No orange slabs. The JT gets re-coloured so it reads on light.\n   - You pick one, then it gets built.\n3. **Built on the site now:**\n   - The role line under the name, one size step smaller, in Clean and Backstage.\n   - The Plotter background for Backstage-lite. The construction lines now appear only during Peek, and the monogram is visible on phones.\n\nBoth go into PR #5. Next you'll get the light Blocks variants to pick from."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2564,"cache_read_input_tokens":283039,"output_tokens":362,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2564,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":362,"cache_read_input_tokens":283039,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2564,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2564},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"conte